      <title>Announcing the RSS Feed Plugin</title>
      <category>feed</category>
      <description></description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I am excited to announce the release of a <a class="tc-tiddlylink tc-tiddlylink-resolves" href="https://plugin-library.tiddlyhost.com/#%24%3A%2Fplugins%2Ftheophile.dev%2Frss-feed">new plugin</a> designed to allow your audience to follow your wiki. This new tool automatically generates a valid RSS 2.0 feed directly from your specified tiddlers and pushes the file from your wiki, straight to GitHub.</p>]]></content:encoded>
